      "writtenOn": "2020-01-22T21:02:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "See https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/docs/+/master/design_docs/cros_board_info.md\nThe FW_CONFIG field is not shared across boards - each board is free to define FW_CONFIG as it needs.",
